# Secret and endpoint names only. Copy to .env (chmod 0600) and fill your own values; never commit .env.
# Non-secret tool paths, external reference directories and account UUIDs belong in .control/*.local.json (see bin/setup_local.py).

# --- TianGong LCA platform & OAuth sessions (editor / manager roles) ---
